# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained model artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# best_model.pkl and model_metadata.json are committed intentionally
# so the API can be deployed without retraining in CI/CD environments
# (Docker builds and Jenkins pipelines load the model directly from the repo).
*.pkl
!src/model/best_model.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.onnx
# src/model/ directory itself is NOT ignored so the above negations work

